Got lunch plans after service on Sunday, June 28th? No? Perfect!

&nbsp;

Let's get lunch together after service! NO RSVP, JUST COME! Spend extra connection time over warm, crusty bread and mention Thrive Vineyard Church when ordering!

Come hang out, eat some great food, and have real conversations about life, faith, and meaning at Youth Alpha. No pressure. No judgment. Just a space to ask questions, share your thoughts, and explore what you believe. Bring your friends, bring your questions, and find some answers.
Coming to Thrive on January 8th and 22nd, from 6:30-8:00PM. For more information, contact David at david.rak24@gmail.com
&nbsp;

Creating space to worship together with an acoustic-led worship night. Join us for our <strong>local acoustic-led worship night in Barrington</strong>, an unstructured night <strong>SOLELY</strong> for the purpose of pouring our hearts out and ministering the Lord through expressions of spontaneous song, music, prayer and surrender. All are welcome to come and connect with the Lord however that looks!

&nbsp;

For more info, contact Mary: mvsirois@gmail.com

<a href="http://thrivevineyard.com/events/">Looking for more upcoming events? Click here!</a>

&nbsp;

<iframe title="YouTube video player" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/I4ZMo3YxXG0?si=PozFYV7elU-Gbt4_" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>

Bring the whole family, grab your comfiest Christmas pajamas, and join us for an unforgettable (<strong>FREE!</strong>) holiday celebration! 🥞✨ PJ's &amp; Pancakes is a festive family event full of holiday cheer. Enjoy a delicious pancake bar, get silly with Christmas karaoke, play some Christmas Bingo, and don’t miss our amazing donut wall! Plus, make your own hot cocoa jars for a sweet take-home treat, snap some memories at our Christmas photo wall, and so much more! December 6th from 9-10:30am at Thrive.

Fill out the form below or <a href="https://thrivevineyard.churchsuite.com/events/ht6rjjys">click here</a> to sign up!

&nbsp;

&lt;iframe frameborder="0" height="1000" scrolling="yes" src="https://thrivevineyard.churchsuite.com/events/ht6rjjys?details=0&amp;photo=0&amp;description=0&amp;location=0&amp;gmap=0&amp;signup_form=1" style="border-width:0" width="100%"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;

Join us for a festive evening of connection, joy, and celebration at Thrive's <strong>Women’s </strong><strong>Christmas Connection</strong><strong>! </strong>We’ll enjoy a Baked Potato Bar Potluck, where each of you is invited to bring your favorite baked potato topping to share. Plus, bring a dozen cookies for a delightful cookie exchange! <strong>Please RSVP by Friday, Nov. 29th.</strong> with the potato topping you plan to bring, so we can ensure a delicious variety! Dress in your festive best, and don’t forget to bring a friend! Scan the QR code to sign up!

&nbsp;

&nbsp;
